  "descriptionMarkdown": "This seven segment display extracts a certain digit from a number, and displays it.\n\nUsage:\n\n1. aquire a continuous number signal, e.g. 3626, convert it to signal V\n\n2. connect V to the input decider combinator ( V / number -> P )\n\n3. set the number that is the devisor of V the digit you want to display.\n    example, you want to display \"2\" (tens) from the number 3626 -> set the devisor number 10 -> ( V / 10 -> P )\n    display \"3\" (thousands) from the number 3626 -> set the devisor number 1000 -> ( V / 1000 -> P )\n",
